# Line endings are LF in the working tree, everywhere.
#
# Without this, a Windows clone with the default core.autocrlf=true checks text
# files out with CRLF. That is invisible for source — the toolchain does not
# care — but the fixtures under fixtures/ are compared byte-for-byte, so a
# rewritten index.html fails a test that passes on every other machine.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries must never be touched. Marking them explicitly is cheaper than
# trusting content detection on a file that happens to start with ASCII.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.webm  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ico   binary
